<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xmlns:mstts="https://www.w3.org/2001/mstts" xml:lang="zh-CN"><voice name="zh-CN-YunxiNeural"><bookmark mark="l0"/><mstts:express-as style="narration-relaxed" styledegree="0.8"><prosody rate="-1%" pitch="0%">第二周，顾客的需求<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">回到一百箱</prosody>。可货<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">还在路上</prosody>，各家又怕缺货，继续追加。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l0-end"/><break time="180ms"/><bookmark mark="l1"/><mstts:express-as style="serious" styledegree="0.55"><prosody rate="0%" pitch="-1%">等货集中送到，仓库挤满，大家又<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">一起停订</prosody>。上游<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">一会儿加班</prosody>，<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">一会儿停工</prosody>。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l1-end"/><break time="200ms"/><bookmark mark="l2"/><mstts:express-as style="narration-relaxed" styledegree="0.8"><prosody rate="-2%" pitch="0%">问题<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">不只是卖了多少</prosody>，还在于大家看到了什么，以及<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">多久才能收到货</prosody>。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l2-end"/></voice></speak>